ect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-18T16:13:53","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a3ae37d3-69fd-49a7-a31d-33d0874134a1","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351613246,"PostDateInt":1789370545000,"PostDate":"2026-09-14T15:22:25","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"ESD技术专家(J14792)","OrgId":3605125,"Org":"创新研究院","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖北省·武汉市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 全流程技术设计与开发：主导从底层ESD器件（如GGNMOS、SCR）的物理设计、TCAD仿真与参数化单元开发，到工艺测试结构设计、ESD标准单元库建设，最终实现全芯片防护网络规划、设计规则定制及物理验证（DRC/LVS/PERC）的全流程工作；\n2. 设计体系建设与IP管理：主导建立、优化并维护公司级的ESD设计流程、防护设计规范及技术标准，开发可复用的ESD IP库（含高压、高速等特殊防护结构），并开发配套的EDA自动化脚本（如使用Python/SKILL）以提升设计集成与验证效率；\n3. 深度技术攻关与失效分析：主导解决产品开发中遇到的重大ESD、EOS、Latch-up可靠性问题，运用FIB、TEM等分析工具进行失效定位，深入分析根因并提供从器件结构优化、电路调整到版图改进的有效解决方案，同时制定覆盖芯片级（CDM/MM）和系统级的全面ESD测试与验证方案；\n4. 团队领导与客户技术协同：主导ESD技术团队的构建、技术指导与能力建设，推动知识沉淀与传承，作为技术接口为内外部客户提供高级别ESD技术支持，包含设计评审、失效分析报告解读、防护方案定制及技术培训。","Require":"1. 教育背景与专业知识：微电子、电子工程、半导体物理等相关专业，硕士及以上学历；\n2. 专业技能与资格：精通半导体器件物理、工艺制程及可靠性机理，能使用SPICE/TCAD完成器件与电路仿真，具备定制化版图设计与可靠性测试规划（TLP等）能力，能应用FIB、TEM等工具进行失效分析；\n3. 行业与专业经验：8年以上集成电路ESD防护设计经验，拥有先进工艺节点产品成功流片经验，熟悉Logic、BCD、RF等技术平台者优先；\n4. 项目/任务成果：主导过至少一款先进工艺节点的全芯片ESD防护方案设计，并成功流片，具备多项目、多工艺平台ESD IP开发与管理的项目成果；\n5. 工作地点：武汉或者上海；\n6. 其他要求：具有卓越的技术洞察力和复杂问题解决能力，优秀的跨部门沟通协作能力以及培养和带领团队的热情。","ClassificationOne":"工艺技术类","ClassificationTwo":"研发","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-14T15:22:25","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"beb47553-aea8-46bd-9e36-6b6cc248e581","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351611140,"PostDateInt":1788862149000,"PostDate":"2026-09-08T18:09:09","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"采购工程师(J14419)","OrgId":2792929,"Org":"Operation Center","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖北省·武汉市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.订单管理：依据决策的价格和商务条款下达订单，确保订单的合法合规；\n2.交付管理：统筹端到端流程，主动化解执行瓶颈，确保准时交付；\n3.动态管理：灵活调整订单应对变化，妥善处理采购逆向流程；\n4.付款管理：每月和厂商对